<OmiFixPdf>

  <!-- ASX Signal B FIX Manual. FIXT.1.1 session with FIX 5.0 application messages delivering a
       progressive intra-day trade confirmation feed for an ASX Trading Participant, covering all
       instruments listed on the ASX Trade platform. Tags marked "REVIEW" are ASX specific extensions. -->

  <Header>
